    s.hburst    := Mux1H(g, masters.map(_.hburst))
    s.hprot     := Mux1H(g, masters.map(_.hprot))
    s.hsel      := g.reduce(_ || _)
} }
```
When there is one master, all slaves will receive the master's request whether the master requested the slave  or not. Thankfully, slave would ignore that if **s.hsel**  is clear.

